{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Natural World"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Our Earth"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 12}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le12ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Showing That You Understand Someone's Feelings"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">must</span> followed by an adjective when you want to empathize with someone. When you empathize with someone, you show them that you understand their feelings."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is the structure to follow:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "subject + <span class=\"italic\">must</span> + verb + adjective"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">You must feel depressed.<br/>You must be excited.<br/>They must be shocked!<br/>It must be terrifying to do that!</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use either <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> adjectives or <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> adjectives. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Don't forget to include the verb before the adjective."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Paul</span>: I've stayed up all night.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Jessica</span>: You must be tired."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tania</span>: It must be fascinating living in Europe.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Yeah, it is!"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making Suggestions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use modals to give advice and make suggestions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The most common modals for giving advice are: <br/><span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can think of modals as \u201chelping verbs\u201d. They add meaning to the main verb of a sentence. In this case, these modals add the meaning of advice and suggestion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Should</span> is the most common modal used to give advice and to make suggestions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> are used for giving strong advice and making strong suggestions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main Verb\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">should</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">read</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">more about wildlife preservation.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">ought to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">be</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">more careful about disposing of our garbage.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">had better</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">do</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">more to protect the whales.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "In conversation, it is common to use contractions with <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You ought to watch more wildlife documentaries. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You should consider a \u201cgreen\u201d trip."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You'd better become more aware of the illicit trade in your country."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "preservation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the action of keeping something or someone safe from harm "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: All over the world, wildlife preservation organizations are trying to protect whales."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le12ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "extinct"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "no longer existing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Organizations are trying to protect whales from becoming extinct."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le12ob11aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to wipe out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to completely remove from existence"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If people kept hunting whales, they would wipe out some of the most fascinating mammals in the world."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le12ob11aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "disconnected"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "removed from an issue; out of touch"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I feel so disconnected from the natural world."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le12ob11aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "documentary"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a television program that provides a factual record or report"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I ought to watch more documenta