1, "image": "engenn7le12ob11re2img03.jpg"}, {"time": "18000", "text": "<ul><li>You ought to watch more wildlife documentaries - they are a good reminder that some animals are in danger of being wiped out or already may be extinct.</li><li>You should consider a \u201cgreen\u201d trip - like whale watching or an arctic cruise. Seeing animals like polar bears, narwhals, walruses and seals in their natural habitat can help you feel less disconnected to the world.</li><li>You'd better become more aware of the illicit trade and poaching of protected animals in your country.</li></ul>", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le12ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "50000", "text": "If you could do one of these things, which one would you choose? If we all decided to make a small change in the way we lived and thought about our world, we could make a big difference! You must be excited to try something out!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le12ob11re2img05.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le12ob11re2img03.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}